Package: floaties
Title: Swimlane and Waterfall Plots for Clinical Trial Monitoring
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Vedha", "Viyash", , "vedha@appsilon.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Draws the two charts a medical monitor reaches for first while a
    trial is running: a waterfall of best response, and a swimlane of what
    happened to each subject over time. Each plot renders with 'ggplot2',
    'plotly' or 'echarts4r' from the same call, and takes column roles as
    arguments so it does not care where the data came from.
